 "intro_html": "A royal-court dish from Damyang: short-rib meat chopped fine, seasoned like <a href=\"galbi-jjim.html\">galbi</a> and shaped into flat patties. At home ordinary <b>minced beef with some fat</b> works well. The patties are browned in a steel pan, finished under a lid and brushed with a <b>glossy soy-honey glaze</b>. Mild and good for lunch boxes. This is a home adaptation built from several Korean sources and has not been kitchen tested.",
