 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<p>For the traditional texture, cut <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"300\" data-s=\"0\">300 g</span> boneless short rib (kaburga) into small pieces, chop it finely with a knife and mix it with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"200\" data-s=\"0\">200 g</span> minced beef.</p>",
   "title_html": "Short rib version"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>The patties also work on a grill pan, or in the oven at <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"220\" data-s=\"0\">220 °C</span> for 12 minutes; brush with glaze for the last 2 minutes.</p>",
   "title_html": "Grill pan or oven"
  }
 ],
