  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mince the garlic and spring onions finely. Put everything for the patties except the oil into a bowl.</li><li>Knead with your hand for <b>2–3 minutes</b>, until the mixture turns sticky and holds together; this keeps the patties from crumbling.</li></ul>",
