   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Divide into <b>6 portions</b>. Toss each between your palms to push out the air, then flatten it into an oval about <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1.5 cm</span> thick</b>. Press a shallow dent into the centre with your thumb so it stays flat as it cooks.</li><li>Chill the patties for <b>20 minutes</b> so they firm up.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
