   "time_html": "<span>~5 min, plus 20 min</span>",
   "title": "Shape and chill",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"500\">500 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Minced beef, about 20% fat"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in the steel pan on <b>medium</b>. Lay in the patties and cook for <b>3 minutes</b> without moving them, until browned underneath. Turn, cover and cook for <b>4 minutes</b>.</li><li>Mix the glaze. Uncover, brush or spoon it over the patties, turn them once and cook for <b>1 minute</b> more, until shiny and sticky.</li></ul>",
